{"type":"text","timestamp":"2026-09-26T20:36:38.373Z","data":{"text":"Task complete.\n\n**Summary**\n\n- `src/core/status/change-locations.ts`\n  - Added optional `stackedFolder` to `ChangeTree`.\n  - `treeAt` now accepts `{ worktreeFolder?, stackedFolder? }`.\n  - Added `stackedRoot(vcs, repoRoot)` = parent of `stackedPath(...)`, naming no path literally.\n  - `changeTrees` appends one stacked tree per directory directly under the stacked root, skipping folders already named by a worktree, and adds nothing when the directory is missing.\n  - `listChanges` treats stacked trees like worktree trees: contributes only the named folder, and the project root drops any active folder a worktree or stacked tree names.\n- `tests/change-locations-stacked.test.ts` (new) covers the three required scenarios.\n\n**Verification**\n- `node --import tsx --test tests/change-locations-stacked.test.ts` — 3 pass.\n- Related suites (`change-locations`, `change-locations-worktrees`, `serve-sse-worktrees`, `status-worktree`) — 19 pass.\n- `pnpm verify` (typechecks, build, full suite, lint) — passed.\n\nResult written to `openspec/changes/094-stacking/.run/results/2.md`.\nTouched: `src/core/status/change-locations.ts`, `tests/change-locations-stacked.test.ts`."}}
